Package: edgeicgrs
Title: Rust Backend for edgeicg
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ruben", "Dries", , "rdries@bu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Compiled kernels for the edgeicg package: a generic cross-product (t(x) %*% y) through faer's
    cache-blocked, SIMD matrix multiply, so the method's hotspot runs fast on every platform independent of
    the BLAS R is linked to.
